<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange ended lower in moderate trading Thursday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average fell 27.05 to 7330.18.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 0.80 to 438.86.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.07.</p>
<p>Advancers outpaced decliners 1435 to 1043.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 464,040,000 compared with 487,183,610 on Wednesday.</p>
